# Cluster-wide MEMORY (MiB) per scaling configuration, averaged over 10 runs.
#
# Per run, per (scale, arm): each container's mean usage over its
# measurement window, summed over every pod in the part, then summed
# over the RPS ladder 100 200 400 800 1200 1600 2000.
# The RPS sweep is part of one run, so it is summed, not averaged; the
# mean and sample stddev below are across the runs only.
#
